English translation:

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:41.570
What is it, Shiro?

00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:21.890
Try to hold on!

00:02:54.670 --> 00:03:02.260
The small hero
Birth of Silver!

00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:15.420
<i>Gohei Takeda, nicknamed "Grandpa".
67 years old.</i>

00:03:15.570 --> 00:03:20.480
<i>5 years ago, the bear Akakabuto
ripped his left ear off.</i>

00:03:20.620 --> 00:03:24.470
<i>Ever since,
he's been hunting the bear.</i>

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:28.990
<i>Riki here is Shiro's offspring and
Akakabuto killed Shiro.</i>

00:03:58.010 --> 00:04:01.680
Hurry up!
The others are leaving soon!

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:04.020
-Don't rush me.

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:10.700
-Who's that boy?
-The owners son.

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:16.910
Dad! Mom! She gave birth!
Fuji got puvvies!

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:19.370
Puvvies?

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:23.540
Fuji's puvvies!
Fuji's puvvies!

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:26.570
Dad, mom! Come take a look!

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:28.800
We're coming...

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:32.370
Look! Three of them!

00:04:34.360 --> 00:04:35.160
Oh that...

00:04:35.240 --> 00:04:37.960
Is this puvvies? Really cute.

00:04:45.610 --> 00:04:47.350
One's got stripes!

00:04:47.350 --> 00:04:47.830
Yippie!!!
One's got stripes!

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:49.350
Yippie!!!

00:04:51.400 --> 00:04:54.220
Well done, Fuji!

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:56.760
Great!

00:04:57.050 --> 00:05:01.980
Daisuke, see that you
don't step on the puppies.

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:09.750
Look, it's got stripes.
Silver and striped!

00:05:13.480 --> 00:05:17.920
Don't you see that Fuji is getting worried.
Give the puppy back.

00:05:20.770 --> 00:05:23.670
Oh yeah...
Sorry, sorry.

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:27.670
Striped.
You really have stripes.

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:30.960
Hey you, is this an Akita-dog?

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:31.130
Thats right.
Hey you, is this an Akita-dog?

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:31.970
Thats right.

00:05:32.110 --> 00:05:34.870
Is it really that special?

00:05:36.330 --> 00:05:38.530
The white one is much cuter.

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:43.130
Stupid! You just don't see it.

00:05:43.260 --> 00:05:44.330
But..

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:50.560
A striped Akita is the best
dog to hunt bear with.

00:05:51.770 --> 00:05:55.150
Listen! All Akita used to be striped.

00:05:55.520 --> 00:05:59.030
They should have
a large head -

00:05:59.110 --> 00:06:01.550
and short, erect ears.

00:06:01.690 --> 00:06:04.020
Daisuke, you know a lot.

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:10.780
I love dogs.
The tail is curled and fuzzy.

00:06:10.950 --> 00:06:15.570
And they need to have wide paws
and short legs, like me.

00:06:21.050 --> 00:06:23.780
Oh yeah! I'll show him to Grandpa Takeda.

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:25.370
Grandpa Takeda?

00:06:25.520 --> 00:06:29.180
'Cause the father of the puppies
is Grandpa's dog Riki.

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:32.570
Riki needs to see the striped one.

00:06:33.390 --> 00:06:36.210
But first he needs a name.

00:06:36.770 --> 00:06:41.920
What would be good?
Silver and striped...

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:47.070
Now I know!
Silver!

00:06:47.650 --> 00:06:51.970
<i>And so Silver was born.
A brave, striped puppy...</i>

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:56.080
<i>...whose heavy fate
was to become a bear-dog.</i>

00:06:58.710 --> 00:07:00.280
Wait!

00:07:03.010 --> 00:07:05.650
Don't be in such a hurry!

00:07:07.130 --> 00:07:10.840
We have to, the skier
is in trouble.

00:07:13.430 --> 00:07:16.040
Look, he's gone toward
Kotobukisawa.

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:21.520
Genji, from the next village,
had bad luck this morning.

00:07:34.590 --> 00:07:38.120
It can't be Akakabuto.

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:41.800
I know Akakabuto's tracks when I see them.

00:07:41.970 --> 00:07:49.100
It won't be good for tourism
if there's talk about bears.

00:07:49.890 --> 00:07:54.310
Can't we keep this as a secret?

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:58.450
I won't promise you anything,
this is Akakabuto we're talking about.

00:07:58.690 --> 00:08:06.280
Grandpa, you made him angry.

00:08:06.300 --> 00:08:07.760
What?

00:08:11.980 --> 00:08:15.200
Your bullet damaged his nerve-system.

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:20.440
Now he can't hibernate and attacks people.

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:29.480
I'm not blaming you, but
when you start harassing me...

00:08:29.520 --> 00:08:33.810
Be quiet!
Do you want Akakabuto to hear?

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:46.150
What is it?

00:08:46.150 --> 00:08:47.600
He's picked up a scent.
What is it?

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:53.540
What is it?

00:08:53.570 --> 00:08:54.970
Look over there!

00:08:55.830 --> 00:08:58.310
Blood!

00:09:09.290 --> 00:09:13.330
Riki, what's the matter?

00:09:18.730 --> 00:09:21.300
Akakabuto, Run!

00:09:31.640 --> 00:09:35.430
Akakabuto is a wild bear
who's killed many people!

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:38.090
<i>Shoot to kill!</i>

00:09:38.090 --> 00:09:38.590
<i>Roger.</i>
<i>Shoot to kill!</i>

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:38.920
<i>Roger.</i>

00:09:43.260 --> 00:09:43.930
Grandpa!

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:49.070
Where are Grandpa and Riki?

00:10:02.250 --> 00:10:05.040
What happened to Grandpa and Riki?

00:10:05.070 --> 00:10:07.190
Akakabuto got them.

00:10:14.200 --> 00:10:17.820
I don't believe you!

00:10:22.620 --> 00:10:24.780
Fuji...!

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:31.160
Listen to me, Riki...

00:10:34.470 --> 00:10:38.180
Silver...
Akakabuto killed your father.

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:46.080
That's what they say but I don't
believe them! Your father is a bear-dog.

00:10:46.150 --> 00:10:50.560
He won't die before he has seen you!

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:15.120
<i>The storm called off the search.
It lasted for a week</i>

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:19.150
<i>and all hope of finding
Gohei and Riki were gone.</i>

00:12:10.890 --> 00:12:12.180
Take this...

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:25.080
Riki, it's already been a week.
We'll die of starvation and cold.

00:12:27.880 --> 00:12:35.820
Riki, you got wounds on your back.
And I can't stand on my feet.

00:12:35.840 --> 00:12:37.030
Riki...

00:12:50.530 --> 00:12:56.390
I can't die here!
I will make it and kill Akakabuto!

00:12:57.470 --> 00:13:02.170
Riki, I will survive this at all cost!

00:13:13.400 --> 00:13:21.330
Riki, your life is my life.
You can't die here.

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:23.150
Riki!

00:13:34.280 --> 00:13:38.100
Riki, listen to me.
This is an order.

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:44.120
Now eat my flesh!

00:13:46.640 --> 00:13:49.200
Eat... eat!

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:52.720
Eat, Riki!

00:13:55.840 --> 00:14:00.340
Eat, gather your strength
and run to the village.

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:02.230
Riki!

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:10.820
Riki, I didn't raise you to
disobey orders!

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:24.990
Riki, don't care about him.
He can't come down.

00:14:26.030 --> 00:14:27.260
Let it be!

00:14:28.890 --> 00:14:31.010
Riki!

00:14:37.370 --> 00:14:43.530
They've called off the search.
Now they're only looking for bodies.

00:14:43.630 --> 00:14:45.600
Father, I'm coming with you!

00:14:45.630 --> 00:14:47.960
Don't be foolish, you're staying at home!

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:51.240
I want to show Silver to Riki.

00:14:51.270 --> 00:14:54.090
I'm getting Riki home.

00:14:54.570 --> 00:14:56.780
Towards Kotobukisawa!

00:14:58.550 --> 00:15:00.320
Do we really have to stay at home?

00:15:00.340 --> 00:15:01.340
Silver!

00:15:05.010 --> 00:15:06.110
Of course!

00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:47.710
Silver... We might find
Riki at Kotobukisawa!

00:15:56.870 --> 00:16:03.030
<i>For bear-dogs strength is power,
and life force is a strength.</i>

00:16:04.220 --> 00:16:08.910
<i>Riki was a true bear-dog.
He had both.</i>

00:16:24.020 --> 00:16:26.260
It's Riki!

00:16:27.140 --> 00:16:28.800
He's alive!

00:16:30.100 --> 00:16:32.940
Look Silver!
It's your father!

00:16:33.040 --> 00:16:39.050
<i>Silver saw his father
fight against Akakabuto.</i>

00:16:39.210 --> 00:16:43.770
<i>It was an unforgettable experience
for a small puppy.</i>

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:47.160
Riki is in danger! Akakabuto!

00:16:50.270 --> 00:16:52.090
Take this!

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:14.550
Riki, help me!

00:17:34.050 --> 00:17:35.860
Daisuke, are you all right?

00:17:37.730 --> 00:17:39.090
Grandpa!

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:42.090
That was close, Daisuke.

00:17:43.560 --> 00:17:46.800
You're alive!
Thank god!

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:48.100
Daisuke...

00:17:48.170 --> 00:17:48.870
Silver is?

00:17:48.870 --> 00:17:49.040
Silver?
Silver is?

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:49.790
Silver?

00:17:50.060 --> 00:17:51.540
My dog. Riki's puppy.

00:17:51.760 --> 00:17:53.260
Riki's puppy?

00:17:54.140 --> 00:17:55.640
Silver, Riki's puppy!

00:17:55.930 --> 00:17:57.200
No, Daisuke!

00:17:57.810 --> 00:17:58.650
But Silver is!

00:17:58.900 --> 00:18:01.320
You will die if you go out there!

00:18:17.550 --> 00:18:18.010
Riki!

00:18:18.010 --> 00:18:19.380
Riki!
Riki!

00:18:25.410 --> 00:18:26.870
Run, Silver!

00:18:30.560 --> 00:18:31.980
Silver!

00:18:44.690 --> 00:18:45.920
Riki!

00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:50.020
Riki, hurry up!
Hurry! Run away!

00:18:53.770 --> 00:18:54.720
Riki!

00:18:59.590 --> 00:19:01.660
Riki...!

00:19:28.320 --> 00:19:30.870
Riki!

00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:47.780
Damn you Akakabuto!

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:51.920
Grandpa!

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:59.270
I'm here...
Kill me if you can!

00:19:59.330 --> 00:20:04.410
I won't die easily!

00:20:19.300 --> 00:20:21.200
Come on, Akakabuto!

00:20:35.060 --> 00:20:38.840
Wait! Stop, Akakabuto!

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:46.070
<i>Hey? Anyone there?</i>

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:47.480
It's dad and the others!

00:20:48.820 --> 00:20:51.680
There they are! Over here!

00:20:55.630 --> 00:20:59.000
Riki! My Riki...!

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:06.030
Riki!

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:10.430
It's Grandpa Takeda!
He's alive!

00:21:12.770 --> 00:21:14.760
Riki...

00:21:14.770 --> 00:21:16.070
Riki!

00:21:16.720 --> 00:21:18.780
Watch out, Daisuke!

00:21:30.630 --> 00:21:31.730
Riki...

00:21:33.130 --> 00:21:37.070
Riki...!

00:21:38.510 --> 00:21:44.360
Riki, I promise you that your
death wasn't in vain.

00:21:45.520 --> 00:21:48.270
I promise!

00:21:53.150 --> 00:21:57.170
Damn!
Riki!

00:22:00.310 --> 00:22:06.800
<i>5 years ago Shiro, Riki's father got killed.
And now Riki, the father of Silver.</i>

00:22:06.850 --> 00:22:12.390
<i>They both fell a victim
at the claws of Akakabuto</i>

00:22:16.320 --> 00:22:21.820
Fuji, such a fine puppy.
You gave birth to a striped one.

00:22:23.010 --> 00:22:27.760
<i>And so begins the story of a
fierce battle between Akakabuto -</i>

00:22:27.800 --> 00:22:32.380
<i>and three generations
of bear-dogs.</i>

00:22:36.010 --> 00:22:38.060
<i>Silver walked on silently
with the fresh memory of</i>

00:22:38.150 --> 00:22:42.620
<i>his father and Akakabuto's
battle on his mind.</i>

00:22:43.920 --> 00:22:49.350
<i>To Silver, this was
a cruel and unavoidable fate.</i>
